        "Description": "Welcome to Mendoza Forty Seven,\r\rYour primary target is Aron Ford Jr. an important legal actor in the Yates empire, with direct connections to Yates, Carlisle and Providence. \r\rFurthermore, it is essential his &quot;unfortunate end&quot; remain undiscovered. As such, Corvo Black (a personal fixer for the Yates empire), Juan Cortazar (the head of security) and Pam Kingsley (investigative journalist) must all be eliminated.\r\rGodspeed!",
